stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Detected: Edge AI pipeline emits domain event
    Detected --> Queued: SQLite store-and-forward (edge)
    Queued --> Ingested: POST ingest API accepted (event_id + occurred_at)
    Ingested --> Rejected: schema validation failed
    Rejected --> [*]

    Ingested --> Persisted: ParkingEvent row committed
    Persisted --> Outboxed: outbox_message committed in same TX
    Outboxed --> Published: Outbox Relay publishes to RabbitMQ
    Published --> Consumed: consumer processes + acks
    Consumed --> [*]

    Published --> RetryPending: consumer nack / delivery timeout
    RetryPending --> Published: retry with exponential backoff
    RetryPending --> DeadLettered: retries exhausted
    DeadLettered --> Consumed: manual replay after fix

    Queued --> Queued: retry from edge (network down),<br/>deduped by event_id at ingest
